<title>NORWAY: Bergesen 1996 pre-tax sinks 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Bergesen 1996 pre-tax sinks 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating profit			 575	vs	   277</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit			   380	vs	   489</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norway's largest shipping company is Bergesen ASA. A Reuter poll of 10 analysts forecast an operating result of 417 million crowns and a pre-tax profit of 147 million crowns. Four analysts recommended to sell the share, two said hold and one said sell.  </p>
<p>Operating revenue		    4,512	vs	 4,359</p>
<p>Operating result before</p>
<p>		     depreciation    1,239	vs	 1,091</p>
<p>Dividend 1996  (crowns)    1.00 per share</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
